      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was officially incorporated on June 4, 1686, and named after Rochester, England, from which early settlers came.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
